      "cooked": "<p>seeing the new lego dimensions video game today made me think, how awesome it would be to have sentinels of the multiverse legos. Just think building a freedom 5 and baron blade battle out of legos in his mobile defense platform, or even the freedom tower would be great fun.</p><p>Or maybe we should start making our own sets....... Maybe even have a Lego Sentinels of the Multiverse sets we could build and take pictures of for Greater Than Games fun stuff people do with our board game collection</p><p>Shouldnt be to hard to start building the lego enviorments but the minifigure part will be hard for the different characters.</p>",
