      "created_at": "2015-04-09T18:29:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If I was to do these over, I would proably print decals for the torsos. It's what most Lego customisers do, and it makes for a much neater finish. Plus I would Rit Dye some of the pieces that I needed in a different colour, because man, painting these was awful!&nbsp;</p>",
